<title>USA: Raymond James sale of stake to boost Q2 net.</title>
<headline>Raymond James sale of stake to boost Q2 net.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James Financial Inc said Tuesday the sale of stake in Liberty Investment Management Inc will increase its net income in the second quarter.</p>
<p>The company sold its stake in the company earlier this month to Goldman Sachs Asset Management.</p>
<p>Raymond James said it has received about $24.5 million so far, and may receive about $6 million more &quot;if certain conditions are fulfilled,&quot; the comapny said in a statement. &quot;We anticipate that should occur in the immediate future.&quot;</p>
</text>
